2026-04-18 Version 2.0.2
------------------------

- fix where first alert for a mastodon user fails.
- fix double entry (0.0) into the db on invalid negative readings
- add an error log entry if invalid alert_type in raspisump.conf when heartbeat is triggered.
- add stdout error and error log entry if invalid alert_type in raspisump.conf when run alerttest

2026-03-27 Version 2.0.1
------------------------
Fixed bug where units were not changing from metric to imperial on charts and in rsumpsupport file.
Changing the unit type now takes properly on the next valid reading


